Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.01,0:00:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might not take down this boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.91,0:00:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the next one?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.57,0:00:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.03,0:00:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That one's ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.29,0:00:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.25,0:00:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.71,0:00:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not getting past me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.37,0:00:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.69,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure you wanna do this, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.91,0:00:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt even you can take\Non a whore this big solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.63,0:00:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.85,0:00:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one way to find out for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.53,0:00:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.97,0:00:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, people, you're the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.55,0:00:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mages, let him have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.87,0:00:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Cait!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.81,0:00:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cait, steal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.71,0:00:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cait!
