Dialogue: 2,0:02:38.03,0:02:42.03,Title,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\bord2.25\fs170\c&HE7EAC5&\3c&HE7EAC5&\ybord4.5\pos(960,765)}The Monument Of Swordsmen
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.03,0:02:42.03,Title,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\bord6\fs170\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\alpha&H22&\pos(960,765)}The Monument Of Swordsmen
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.19,0:03:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.17,0:03:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He cut through spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.17,0:03:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.09,0:03:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know he could do stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.85,0:03:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.13,0:03:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.39,0:03:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.09,0:03:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compared to a bullet from\Na high-powered rifle,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.71,0:03:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knocking down high-speed\Nspells is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.25,0:03:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.45,0:03:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Battle formation on the double!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.59,0:03:36.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only hold them for a couple!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.33,0:03:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Head for the boss room! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.09,0:03:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold your ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.27,0:03:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.71,0:03:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.75,0:03:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.83,0:04:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't see me yet! You're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.63,0:04:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.29,0:04:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.41,0:04:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Took a wrong turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.59,0:04:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mine's here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.53,0:04:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.63,0:04:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You too, Klein.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.25,0:04:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Kirito, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.97,0:04:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends will take\Ncare of those players.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.43,0:04:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we want to get\Ninto the boss room today,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.75,0:04:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll have to get through the\Nones blocking it ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.51,0:04:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.85,0:04:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.75,0:04:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.43,0:05:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.81,0:05:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.72,0:05:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, no fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.27,0:05:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think you can heal them\Non your own for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.41,0:05:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, I should have enough Main for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.05,0:05:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, then I'm gonna take\Ncare of those enemy mages.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.47,0:06:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuuki! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.31,0:06:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Berserk Healer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.25,0:06:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, guys, the hard part's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.19,0:06:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get that boss. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.59,0:07:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we will beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.05,0:07:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, drink your potions, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.65,0:07:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Max out your HP and MP.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.21,0:07:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stick to the plan and we'll have a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.93,0:07:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know at the start its\Nattack patterns are simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.87,0:07:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay calm and avoid them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.17,0:07:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.83,0:07:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.33,0:07:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those friends of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.23,0:07:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't they here just to help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.95,0:07:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.97,0:08:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They know it's important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.85,0:08:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let's pull this raid off\Nand make it worth their effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.45,0:08:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.21,0:08:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, we can't let you do all this\Nand not give you anything in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.07,0:08:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.37,0:08:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You taught me something I'm\Nalways going to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.87,0:08:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes you have to fight to\Nget your point across, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.45,0:08:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this is our last chance at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.85,0:08:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time's running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.61,0:08:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be long before that guild regroups\Nand comes charging through that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.65,0:08:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do our best to win, so we can\Nflash them a victory sign when they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.29,0:08:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.83,0:08:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When this battle is over, I want\Nyou to tell me all about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.95,0:08:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know about all\Nthe worlds you've been to,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.65,0:08:56.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and all the adventures you've had.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.73,0:09:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes the boss, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.73,0:09:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's mess him up! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.03,0:09:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.97,0:10:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, I feel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.89,0:10:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only three left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.69,0:10:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.75,0:10:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.15,0:10:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let up on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.05,0:10:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.89,0:10:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That boss sure knows how to defend itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.39,0:10:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think that's a random move?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.87,0:10:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using his arms to block?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.93,0:10:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Siune, I have an idea\Nand I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.53,0:10:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you take over healing for 30 seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.85,0:10:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that shouldn't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.81,0:11:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have enough reserves to cover everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.19,0:11:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it, that wasn't random, it's protecting\Na critical weak spot with that move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.35,0:11:21.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see that jewel on its chest?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.07,0:11:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where we need to focus our attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.99,0:11:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we just shatter that\Njewel and we can defeat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.65,0:11:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the very least, we'll\Nput a dent in its HP.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.57,0:11:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, it's too high up to\Nreach and we can't fly in this dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.07,0:11:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll just use our sword skills\Nand keep an eye out for counter moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.77,0:11:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.68,0:11:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go up front and tell them the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.81,0:11:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heal them for a little longer, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.63,0:11:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm on it.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.24,0:11:44.28,UI,,0,0,0,,{\an4\blur0.9\shad0\fsp-3\fscx10.5\fscy48\c&H3E4045&\pos(1155,96)\b1}gave you 2 EX Mana Potions.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.28,0:11:44.32,UI,,0,0,0,,{\an4\blur0.9\shad0\fsp-3\fscx23.5\fscy48\c&H3E4045&\pos(1189.5,96)\b1}gave you 2 EX Mana Potions.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.32,0:11:44.37,UI,,0,0,0,,{\an4\blur0.9\shad0\fsp-3\fscx35\fscy48\c&H3E4045&\pos(1222.5,96)\b1}gave you 2 EX Mana Potions.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.37,0:11:44.41,UI,,0,0,0,,{\an4\blur0.9\shad0\fsp-3\fscx45\fscy48\c&H3E4045&\pos(1251,96)\b1}gave you 2 EX Mana Potions.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.41,0:11:44.45,UI,,0,0,0,,{\an4\blur0.9\shad0\fsp-1.5\fscx48\fscy48\c&H3E4045&\pos(1272,96)\b1}gave you 2 EX Mana Potions.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.45,0:11:45.66,UI,,0,0,0,,{\an4\blur0.9\shad0\fscx48\fscy48\c&H3E4045&\pos(1281,96)\b1}gave you 2 EX Mana Potions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.17,0:11:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.73,0:11:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ashina!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.64,0:11:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.33,0:11:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found a weak spot on the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.27,0:11:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see that jewel on its chest?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.99,0:11:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Below the necks?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.91,0:11:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you hit that, you'll\Ndo some major damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.15,0:12:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.79,0:12:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.95,0:12:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's high!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.27,0:12:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't reach it even if I jumped!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.15,0:12:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could if you had the\Nright springboard, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.23,0:12:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.77,0:12:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tenchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.21,0:12:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he swings that\Nhammer again, take a knee!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.15,0:12:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our chance to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.87,0:12:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.27,0:12:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.53,0:12:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh... Sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.15,0:13:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.55,0:13:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.19,0:13:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.03,0:13:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We beat him, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.33,0:13:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.49,0:13:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.33,0:13:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I'm wiped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.89,0:14:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.27,0:14:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You you you gotta be kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.85,0:14:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great job, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.73,0:14:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of sad it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.03,0:14:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.55,0:14:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's one last thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.73,0:14:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.53,0:14:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.73,0:14:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's have a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.27,0:14:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll pull out all the stops. Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.93,0:14:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got enough now to\Nparty in style, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.13,0:14:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.05,0:14:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are we going to have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.15,0:15:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we should go to some big city and\Nbuy out a restaurant for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.83,0:15:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, actually, if you guys want to,\Nwe could have it at my place in-game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's small, but cozy. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.37,0:15:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.49,0:15:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, please forgive us, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.77,0:15:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really appreciate your\Noffer to host the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.19,0:15:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.31,0:15:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind. It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.39,0:15:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd be honored to have our\Nvictory party at your home, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.13,0:15:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.51,0:15:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, we're heading over to\Nthe Lombard Central Market.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.71,0:15:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got ourselves some shopping to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.15,0:15:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get some of that ale!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.89,0:16:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your place is so cool, Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.43,0:16:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, there's already food and drinks out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.85,0:16:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.87,0:16:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to get some of these things!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.79,0:16:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It smells so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.37,0:16:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put those over there, yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.43,0:16:24.65,Note,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\frz5.46\c&H4B4E4B&\move(1080,390,966.495,389.97,30,3200)}C{*\c&H4E504E&}o{*\c&H505350&}n{*\c&H535653&}g{*\c&H555856&}r{*\c&H585A58&}a{*\c&H5A5D5B&}t{*\c&H5D605E&}u{*\c&H606260&}l{*\c&H626463&}a{*\c&H656766&}t{*\c&H676A69&}i{*\c&H6A6C6B&}o{*\c&H6C6E6E&}n{*\c&H6F7171&}s {\c&H747676&}\N{*\c&H6A6C6B&}o{*\c&H606260&}n {\c&H4B4E4B&}y{*\c&H535654&}o{*\c&H5B5E5C&}u{*\c&H646665&}r {\c&H747676&}Victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.71,0:16:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.25,0:16:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not scared of a\Nlittle alcohol, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.99,0:16:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I just want to pace myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.87,0:16:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so the worst MMO\NI ever played was...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.55,0:16:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this one from the U .S.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.19,0:16:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,called Insect Site.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.59,0:16:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, that one's bad. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.25,0:16:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.45,0:16:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bugs everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it were just the monsters, no problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.37,0:16:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you gotta play as a bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.51,0:17:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to play as a bipedal ant, so\NI guess I didn't have it too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.15,0:17:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you should have seen her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.17,0:17:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.08,0:17:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't say anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.37,0:17:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was a giant caterpillar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.31,0:17:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spitting silk like whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.37,0:17:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.61,0:17:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you got to travel to\Nsome really cool places together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.85,0:17:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.93,0:17:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you come off like you've\Nbeen playing VR Miss forever. Do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.53,0:17:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I play this one a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.87,0:17:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you how many hours it took\Nto get the money to buy this cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.49,0:17:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.07,0:17:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, when you said this place\Nwas cozy, you weren't kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.83,0:17:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got this really cool old-timey vibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.09,0:17:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.41,0:17:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so peaceful, I\Ncould sit here all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.49,0:17:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Sune?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.39,0:17:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, but I just remembered\Nwhen we asked you to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.39,0:17:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We said we'd give you whatever\Nthe boss dropped in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.89,0:17:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was money, though, and we spent a lot\Nof it on food and drink for our party.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.69,0:18:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have we done?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.71,0:18:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.62,0:18:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we don't have anything to give you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.05,0:18:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.03,0:18:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about a favor instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.01,0:18:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.93,0:18:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm a little\Nsad the quest is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.29,0:18:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to get to know you better, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are so many things\NI want to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.37,0:18:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, sometimes you gotta\Nfight to get your point across.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.27,0:18:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki, would you let me\Njoin this sleeping night?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.91,0:18:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, i wish you could, but it's\Nlike this is a temporary thing for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.39,0:18:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And like, come spring\Nwe'll be splitting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.11,0:19:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after that, i doubt any of\Nus will be diving much anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.99,0:19:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but can I join until then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.33,0:19:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want us to be friends
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.41,0:19:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be friends with all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.71,0:19:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still enough time\Nfor that, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.41,0:19:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.32,0:19:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.31,0:19:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.25,0:19:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.43,0:19:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.65,0:19:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have put you on\Nthe spot like that, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.07,0:19:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, Asuna...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.11,0:19:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.81,0:19:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you see, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.31,0:19:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.45,0:19:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.69,0:19:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I was so pushy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.61,0:19:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.71,0:19:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.29,0:19:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.20,0:19:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reason we beat the boss, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.27,0:19:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, the monument\Nin the Black Iron Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.37,0:19:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's been updated\Nby now. Yeah, guys. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, know what we should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.47,0:19:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should take our picture with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.13,0:19:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great idea. Best one yet. Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.01,0:20:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.95,0:20:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.86,0:20:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.31,0:20:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.61,0:20:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.11,0:20:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.69,0:20:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.89,0:20:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait for me! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.61,0:20:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.97,0:20:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.69,0:20:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.11,0:20:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got our names on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.61,0:20:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.87,0:20:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take that picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.03,0:20:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yuki. Big smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.41,0:21:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is. You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.11,0:21:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I finally did. How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.97,0:21:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you go again, Yuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.21,0:21:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.12,0:21:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You called me sis just now. That's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.95,0:21:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in the boss room, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.31,0:21:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.01,0:21:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.25,0:21:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.87,0:21:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.63,0:21:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.05,0:21:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
